g-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%9C%9C%E5%84%BF\" title=\"金蜜儿\"><img alt=\"金蜜儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%9C%9C%E5%84%BF\" title=\"金蜜儿\">金蜜儿</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>沿着77号公路</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306003</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“做当地旅游宣传短片的演员？抱歉，我的双休已经排满咯。”<br />女孩像往常一样摆了摆手，用甜美的笑容拒绝了热情的星探，但她随后又叫住了失落离开的对方。<br />“等等，我觉得或许有一场派对可以推掉。”<br />女孩将手伸进包中，抓住记满梦想的笔记本，她突然觉得偶尔也该活用一些送上门的资源。“做模特演员可以，但导演和剪辑也得由我来，没问题吧？”<br />铅黄电影也好，磨坊电影也罢，这些和B级恐怖片一样都是她的心头好，但她从不满足于做一个镜头中标准又美丽的珍妮弗。现在或许就是打破刻板印象的关键一步。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306003\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/94/Belonging-306004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">特别定制双扳机\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">冲击式左轮手枪</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Custom Double-trigger Revolver</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />60<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在拍摄广告时应模特要求而特别定制的道具。<br />联动式，弹容量5发，.45口径，并非模型枪，原型出自模特所喜欢的低成本电影。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ca/Belonging-306005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“好孩子”系列\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">德州特供挂饰</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Good Kid\" Plushie Texas Edition</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />17<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>来自名噪一时的疤面小小小煞星系列作品，电影上映期间仅在德克萨斯当地电影院附送的周边布偶。在收藏家之中是无价之宝。深埋于拍摄小组的道具库中，经模特之手重见天日。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e1/Belonging-306006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“觅心”项链<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Heartseeker\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>模特用现场道具自制的项链。比起道具组准备的大颗仿制珍珠项链，她更希望能在拍摄中展示真实自我。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 铅黄色磨坊1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 铅黄色磨坊2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%A3%A8%E5%9D%8A2.